{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482343-what-are-you-thoughts-on-vtm-swansong","id":1482343,"title":"What are you thoughts on VTM Swansong?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-05-29T21:38:57-07:00","id":1482343,"title":"What are you thoughts on VTM Swansong?","content":"I was watching a walkthrough of the game, and I felt that it was somewhat boring after watching the first hour. I cant really put it into words, but it felt very.... repetitive. I get that its supposed to be more of a social game, but I feel they could have made it similar to LA Noir, where there were some shoot outs, and chases, as well as detective work, like looking for evidence and interrogating suspects.<br /> <br /> I read a couple reviews and it seems that a lot of them have a couple things in common. The characters are somewhat underwhelming, it seems downright impossible most of the time to pass a skill check, and even your disciplines seem unlikely to help in most situations. I feel a lot of players who aren't familiar with VTM are going to be extremely confused with the plot as well, making the game harder to play for them. The game gives information on the lore sure, but I highly doubt a player is going to stop what they are doing and read through it, let alone understand the importance of it.<br /> <br /> I personally wished the characters had ghouls that followed their commands, similar to the ghouls you could obtain in VTM Night Road, to give that feeling of being an actual vampire with powers, instead of an errand boy that runs all around the place.<br /> <br /> But who knows, maybe I'm the only one who thinks like this.<br /> <br /> So what are your thought?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/pub/18.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":27313,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27313-hello","user":"Hello","date":". 05-30-2022, 09:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27313-hello","name":"Hello","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27313_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-29T21:56:05-07:00","id":1482346,"title":"","content":"The Leysha story is very compelling. The Toreador parts are...okay. The Ventrue section is boring AF. I would have liked it much better if I could have fast-forwarded through the non-Leysha parts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-29T23:05:20-07:00","id":1482349,"title":"","content":"I feel like it's basically identical to <i>The Council </i>for better or worse.<br /> <br /> I do feel the game suffers from the fact that it was meant to be a niche tie-in game and now is essentially the face of the video game franchise for V:TM because Bloodlines is now being worked on in an underground bunker somewhere.<br /> <br /> I also agree with the reviews that state the game is weirdly sexless and lacking in beautiful vampires seducing people.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-30T04:16:52-07:00","id":1482366,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482343-what-are-you-thoughts-on-vtm-swansong?p=1482346#post1482346\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Leysha story is very compelling. The Toreador parts are...okay. The Ventrue section is boring AF. I would have liked it much better if I could have fast-forwarded through the non-Leysha parts.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Its probably because the game gave a reason to care about leysha, from the get-go we learn that she is a malkavian, so that means she suffers from a mental illness, and that she just recently gained custody over her child. Not only that, she actually turned her daughter into a vampire that follows her around and provides some commentary. The fact she turned her daughter into a vampire was surprising enough.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, we barely know anything about the venture or toreador.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/pub/18.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27313-hello","name":"Hello","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27313_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-30T05:05:17-07:00","id":1482367,"title":"","content":"I agree. Boring.<br /> <br /> It is so sluggish, slow, silent, still...<br /> <br /> I didn't care about any character.<br /> <br /> I don't know if it is intentional or not, and i have a biased opinion since I think they are a bunch of wannabes in the TRPG, but Ican't take the anarchs seriosly.<br /> <br /> And the game give a prime exemple of how ST railroad feels like everytime Leysha can't use her obfuscate power to easily solve something in the scene because [insert bs contrivance here]. If you think obfuscate is too op in your table just ban it. Don't let the player buy the power and then negate it in-game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24832-blailton","name":"blailton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24832_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-30T16:02:15-07:00","id":1482416,"title":"","content":"I have only watched some reviews and playthroughs.<br /> <br /> Good atmosphere, good visual design, absurd clothing designs in place of character depth.<br /> <br /> I think the writers should have made a tv show rather than a video game. Overall, I had more fun watching <a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt10763820/\" target=\"_blank\">Night Teeth</a> on Netflix.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-30T16:39:30-07:00","id":1482419,"title":"","content":"Like I said, a lot more pressure on this game than should have been due to Bloodlines 2's hiatus. It was meant to be a side game but got shoved to the forefront.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-31T04:38:29-07:00","id":1482477,"title":"","content":"Not an horrible game but a fairly mediocre one indeed, the resource management style gameplay for vitae and willpower is a pain in the ass and the story, while interesting at times, is overall kinda underwhelming, the parts with Leysha are the better ones but the toreador parts are as insignificant as the character (I can't even remember her name) while Galeb is an astonishing example of wasted potential, a charismatic character with a really interesting backstory that really doesn't go anywhere. The price is really not worth the actual value of the game, I usually don't care too much for graphics but for 50 euros I'm expecting at least something on par with the current games, Swansong looks like something that could have been done 10 years ago (hell, I can think of older games with better graphics), the dub is good but nothing that really stands out and last but not least, the epic games store exclusive cut off a huge share of the market for this game, I really doubt it's going to be a financial success at this point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-31T04:42:28-07:00","id":1482478,"title":"","content":"Also I agree with Phipps, there is not enough vampire sexiness which might have to do with the subpar graphics and the limitations of the engine, still I would expect toreadors to have a naked scene every time they are introduced AT THE BARE MINIMUM.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-31T10:07:27-07:00","id":1482503,"title":"","content":"I'm posting my $00.02 without reading for fear of spoilers but I want to say I'm actually quite frustrated just in the prologue. The meters for focus and hunger are confusing as they work in opposite directions. Not only do I fail EVERY focus test in the prologue but every streamer and Youtuber I've watched did as well; giving me the impression that passing these rolls are impossible. <br /> <br /> Sorry for being clueless, but fait accompli in games that you paid over 40 bucks for are about as fun as they are in real life.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-31T14:54:45-07:00","id":1482543,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Father Enoch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482343-what-are-you-thoughts-on-vtm-swansong?p=1482503#post1482503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm posting my $00.02 without reading for fear of spoilers but I want to say I'm actually quite frustrated just in the prologue. The meters for focus and hunger are confusing as they work in opposite directions. Not only do I fail EVERY focus test in the prologue but every streamer and Youtuber I've watched did as well; giving me the impression that passing these rolls are impossible.<br /> <br /> Sorry for being clueless, but fait accompli in games that you paid over 40 bucks for are about as fun as they are in real life.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is pretty expensive. Its probably going to be around $50 after taxes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/pub/18.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27313-hello","name":"Hello","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27313_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-31T20:24:06-07:00","id":1482569,"title":"","content":"I know what it is, I already got it (It was around 40, but only because Epic had a coupon).<br /> <br /> What I meant to say is for that money, I would appreciate a few quality of life nods. Like the ability to save, for example.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-31T22:10:16-07:00","id":1482575,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\