"edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-01T00:51:36-07:00","id":1482581,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s not a bad game but there\u2019s room for improvement. The main characters have different appeals but it\u2019s true that Leysha seems more interesting than Galeb while Emem is in the middle. Scenes are fun and immersive imo. Swansong is not a triple A game for sure but it\u2019s a good enough game to deserve buying imo","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24992-haquim","name":"Haquim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T08:43:33-07:00","id":1482772,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Newb95</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482343-what-are-you-thoughts-on-vtm-swansong?p=1482478#post1482478\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also I agree with Phipps, there is not enough vampire sexiness which might have to do with the subpar graphics and the limitations of the engine, still I would expect toreadors to have a naked scene every time they are introduced AT THE BARE MINIMUM.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No Nudity, but I whipped up this &quot;Gothic Country Music&quot; Vampire. Sort of like Harley Quin (cosplayed by Bianca Beauchamp) crossed with Woody Guthrie.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.heroforge.com/load_config%3D21283472/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.heroforge.com/load_config%3D21283472/</a><br /> That sexy enough for you?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3201,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","user":"Father Enoch","date":". 06-02-2022, 11:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T12:44:21-07:00","id":1482814,"title":"","content":"I played throught the whole game and i liked it. The criticism others has voiced in this thread is valid; Facial animation is a bit stiff, voice acting isn't the greatest and the ressource management can feel a bit like a chore at times.<br /> <br /> However, i found the game puzzles and intrigues pretty satisfying. There's a lot of secret password and code you can totally miss if you're not looking carefuly. The game doesn't hand you a quest journal so it's up to you to take notes. At first, i was a bit irked by it, but then i actually realised that i quite enjoyed that aspect as the game didn't hold my hand.<br /> <br /> For example, in one of the first mission you play as Leysha, there's a choice you gotta make at the end of the mission and if you don't wanna rely on a 33% chance of making a choice throught blind luck, you gotta find clues that point towards the good choice and at no point in the game does it tells you ''X is the right choice'' you gotta figure it out.<br /> <br /> Or in one of Galeb's missions there's a safe you must open to gather all the evidence and the safe code is scathered through the whole place.<br /> <br /> I liked all the character, Leysha is probably the best written one, but Galeb struggling with elder problems and Emem choices between morality and effeciency was interesting as well.<br /> <br /> There's two moment i didn't really liked:<br /> - Emem first mission, after the tutorial mission, is a drag, i didn't liked it.<br /> - The ending isn't presented in a way that's satisfying. It's like a long monologue, with some after credits telling you what happened.<br /> <br /> Overall, i give the game a solid 7. I found it refreshing to have a game based on social interaction and investigations instead of the usual action packed games.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26771-algarik","name":"Algarik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26771_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"115"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T12:49:04-07:00","id":1482816,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Father Enoch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482343-what-are-you-thoughts-on-vtm-swansong?p=1482772#post1482772\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\"